\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  I will stay in God Almighty
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  the ever merciful and tender
\par His love is so pure and perfect
\par Look how all my sinful actions
\par  had made me feel the pain in my heart
\par  because the weight is so heavy.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Look out at my sufferings
\par Your grace that I have lost
\par I have fallen short
\par  in your mercies and in your love
\par  has made me feel that I'm not fit.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Forgive all my iniquities
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Yes, if you have to pay for all these,
\par then who can stand before your wrath?
\par You forewarned us just for your love
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj But man has an unchanged heart always
\par for I, will listen to your voice
\par Give to me a cool heart
\par and I will shout aloud,
\par be merciful!
\par O, let me come to your table,
\par that I may have your peace at last.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  I have put my self in deep sin,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj And you alone can cleanse me from these.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And that can make me clean and safe
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1 If you do not give me my strength,\cf0 
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj Your peace and powers and your spirit
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I will be guilty in my death
\par And so I plead with you.
\par give me Thy grace, O Lord,
\par God the Healer
\par You are the Almighty only,
\par Who heals and gives me a new life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   Then Lord, where ever I shall go,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Where I live and where I sleep,
\par If I wake-up or if I sleep,
\par If  I still live or if I die,
\par Lord of compassion, give me Thy grace
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And let your blessings follow me
\par what I wish from you is;
\par To get thy great Honour
\par now and ever.
\par I have joy and peace in Jesus;
\par \pard      He is the Master of all grace.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

